          "set": "HEADERDATA + HEADERDATAACTION (C), ITEMDATA + ITEMDATAACTION (A add / D delete)",
          "testrun": "none",
          "preview": "rule check only (status below shipment start, deliveries can change only before the planned status, route / carrier exist, authorization). BAPI_SHIPMENT_CHANGE saves by itself (proven on the test system: changes persisted after ROLLBACK), so it is never called in a preview",
