          "note": "not available on S/4HANA: shipments, shipment costs and packing run in SAP TM / EWM there"
        }
      },
      "auth": [
        {
          "object": "V_VTTK_SHT",
          "fields": {
            "SHTYP": "<shipment type>",
            "ACTVT": "02"
          }
        },
        {
          "object": "V_VTTK_TDS",
          "fields": {
            "TPLST": "<transportation planning point>",
            "ACTVT": "02"
          }
        },
        {
          "object": "V_LIKP_VST",
          "fields": {
            "VSTEL": "<shipping point>",
            "ACTVT": "02"
          }
        }
      ],
      "preview_limits": {
        "en": [
          "The change BAPI saves by itself and has no test mode: save-time checks of the shipment run only at execute."
        ],
        "ko": [
          "변경 BAPI는 스스로 저장하고 테스트 모드가 없어요. 운송 저장 시점 체크는 실행할 때만 돌아요."
        ]
